HONEST COMPARISON: kernel vs RAR vs AQUAL, same points, same nuisances, same split
==============================================================================
Nuisance treatment held fixed for EVERY model: Upsilon*_disk = 0.5, Upsilon*_bulge = 0.7,
catalogue distances and inclinations, no per-galaxy freedom anywhere.
Frozen kernel sets, selected on TRAIN by the previous lane:
   best-overall         F3_pade alpha=10.0 beta=1.0 p=1.0, screen rho_ref=1e6 L_q=2 kpc
   best-passing-local   F1_poly alpha=10.0 beta=0.0 p=2.0, screen rho_ref=1e6 L_q=2 kpc

usable galaxies  train 71   validation 23   blind 23

